mise bootstrap: system defaults
mise defaults: 65 value(s) already set
mise defaults: wrote NSGlobalDomain AppleFirstWeekday["gregorian"] = 2, NSGlobalDomain AppleICUDateFormatStrings["1"] = y-MM-dd
mise bootstrap: tools
mise all tools are installed
bootstrap: follow-up
  - relaunch apps that read changed macOS defaults (for example: `killall Dock`, `killall Finder`, `killall SystemUIServer`)
